TI  -  Transcutaneous electrical acupoint stimulation versus dexamethasone for prophylaxis of postoperative nausea and vomiting in breast surgery: a non-inferiority randomized controlled trial
JA  -  Surgery
PY  -  2023
VL  -  174
IS  -  4
SP  -  787‐793
C3  -  PUBMED 37482441,EMBASE 641863991
M3  -  Journal article
KW  -  *Breast Neoplasms [surgery]
