TI  -  Electroacupuncture on PC6 prevents opioid-induced nausea and vomiting after laparoscopic surgery
JA  -  Chinese journal of integrative medicine
PY  -  2013
VL  -  19
IS  -  4
CC  -  Complementary Medicine
SP  -  277‐281
C3  -  PUBMED 23546631
