TI  -  Clinical Study on Transcutaneous Electric Acupoint Stimulation for Swelling Limb after Breast Cancer Operation
JA  -  Shanghaijournal of acupuncture and moxibustion [shanghai zhen jiu za zhi]
PY  -  2016
VL  -  35
IS  -  3
CC  -  Complementary Medicine
