AU  -  Yang, E-H
TI  -  Transcutaneous electrical acupoint-stimulation potentiates the anesthetic effect of enflurane in humans
JA  -  Journal of anesthesia
PY  -  1995
VL  -  9
IS  -  1
CC  -  Complementary Medicine
SP  -  40‐43
C3  -  EMBASE 25112421
M3  -  Journal article
