AB  -  INTERVENTION: Five Elements Music Therapy Group:From 1 day before surgery to 3 days after surgery, patients listened to five elements music for 30 minutes with headphones at a volume of 20‐40 dB;Percutaneous acupoint electrical stimulation group:From 30 min before anesthesia induction, transcutaneous acupuncture points were given at the frequency of 2 100Hz, using dense waves, with an intensity of 1 5mA (no more than 5mA), and gradually increased to the maximum tolerance level of the patient until the end of the operation. ;Five Elements Music Therapy + Transcutaneous Acupoint Electrical Stimulation Group:From 1 day before surgery to 3 days after surgery, patients listened to five elements music for 30 minutes with headphones at a volume of 20‐40 dB.From 30 min before anesthesia induction, transcutaneous acupuncture points were given at the frequency of 2 100Hz, using dense waves, with an intensity of 1 5mA (no more than 5mA), and gradually increased to the maximum tolerance level of the patient until the end of the operation. ;Conventional control group:Control the environmental factors in the ward, and carry out routine nursing measures such as life care and psychological care for patients to reduce the possibility of intraoperative delirium; CONDITION: Delirium PRIMARY OUTCOME: POD; SECONDARY OUTCOME: pain degree;sleep quality; INCLUSION CRITERIA: (1) Age= 60 years old; (2) ASA anesthesia grade I. III., preoperative body temperature 36.0°C 37.5°C; (3) Those who are in stable condition, have clear consciousness and have the ability to express themselves independently; (4) Patients voluntarily participate in the research of this topic, and all have informed consent;
