KW  -  *Arrhythmias, Cardiac [etiology, physiopathology, prevention &amp; control, therapy]
KW  -  *Cholecystectomy, Laparoscopic [adverse effects]
KW  -  *Transcutaneous Electric Nerve Stimulation
