TI  -  Improvement of Postoperative Immunosuppression in Patients Receiving Coronary Artery Bypass Grafting by TEAS
JA  -  https://clinicaltrials.gov/show/NCT02933996
PY  -  2016
CC  -  Complementary Medicine
