AU  -  He, DH
AU  -  Zhang, J
TI  -  Dexamethasone alone vs in combination with transcutaneous electrical acupoint stimulation or tropisetron for prevention of postoperative nausea and vomiting in gynaecological patients undergoing laparoscopic surgery
JA  -  British journal of anaesthesia
PY  -  2015
VL  -  115
IS  -  6
CC  -  Complementary Medicine
CC  -  Gynaecology and Fertility
CC  -  Anaesthesia
SP  -  883‐889
C3  -  PUBMED 26507494,EMBASE 607315417
M3  -  Journal article
KW  -  *dexamethasone/cb [Drug Combination]
KW  -  *laparoscopic surgery
KW  -  *postoperative nausea and vomiting/dt [Drug Therapy]
KW  -  *postoperative nausea and vomiting/ep [Epidemiology]
KW  -  *postoperative nausea and vomiting/pc [Prevention]
KW  -  *postoperative nausea and vomiting/th [Therapy]
