TI  -  Electro-acupuncture decreases postoperative pain and improves recovery in patients undergoing a supratentorial craniotomy
JA  -  American Journal of Chinese Medicine (Gard City, NY)
PY  -  2014
VL  -  42
IS  -  5
CC  -  Complementary Medicine
SP  -  1099‐1109
C3  -  PUBMED 25169910
M3  -  Journal article
