AB  -  INTERVENTION: Electroacupuncture group:Electroacupuncture treatments are performed by a professional acupuncturist. Patients receive minimally invasive acupuncture treatment with a customized acupuncture device at LI4, PC6, ST36 and ST37 acupuncture points. After alcohol disinfection of the skin at the corresponding acupuncture points and drying, disposable stainless steel needles are used, and manual manipulation with rotation or lifting insertion is used to induce qi sensation (soreness, pain, swelling, heaviness or numbness) after acupuncture needle insertion. The electro‐acupuncture stimulator (Huatuo SDZ‐V type, Suzhou Medical Equipment Factory) was connected through electrode wires, and each line interface was connected sequentially to the right dorsal LI4, right forearm P6; left dorsal LI4, left forearm P6; right calf ST36, right calf ST37; left calf ST36, left calf ST37. The power was turned on, and the waveform was set to sparse and dense waveform, and the frequency of sparse and dense waveform was 2/100 Hz. Adjust the intensity according to the patients own feeling, so that the patient can feel the sense of electric current. At the end of the treatment, the elastic bandage, small square gauze and acupuncture needles were removed, a dressing was applied to the acupuncture site, and the postoperative intervention form, related complications and adverse events were recorded in a timely manner.;Sham Electroacupuncture group:Patients in the sham electroacupuncture group also received sham needling at points LI4, PC6, ST36, and ST37. After alcohol disinfection of the skin at the corresponding acupuncture points, the skin was touched (not pierced) using a custom‐made acupuncture device identical to the electroacupuncture group and an acupuncture needle of the same material thickne CONDITION: Colonoscopy PRIMARY OUTCOME: Discomfort Score; SECONDARY OUTCOME: Tolerance Score;Bloating;abdominal pain;anal discomfort;Blood pressure;Heart rate;Satisfaction;Nurse 