TI  -  Effect of electroacupuncture at Baihui (GV 20) and Sishencong (EX-HN 1) on presurgical anxiety in patients with gynecological laparoscopic surgery
JA  -  Zhongguo zhen jiu [Chinese acupuncture &amp; moxibustion]
PY  -  2022
