TI  -  Electroacupuncture for the prevention of postoperative gastrointestinal dysfunction in participants undergoing vascular laparotomy under general anesthesia: a randomized controlled trial
JA  -  Chinese medicine (united kingdom)
PY  -  2017
VL  -  12
