TY  -  JOUR
AN  -  CN-01052737
AU  -  Fan, W-C
AU  -  Ma, W
AU  -  Wang, Y-Q
AU  -  Fu, G-Q
AU  -  Shen, W-D
TI  -  Observation on effect of electroacupuncture of different frequencies on patients after thyroid surgery: a randomized controlled trial
JA  -  World journal of acupuncture - moxibustion
PY  -  2014
VL  -  24
IS  -  4
CC  -  Complementary Medicine
SP  -  35‐40
C3  -  EMBASE 602285732
M3  -  Journal article
KW  -  *acupuncture analgesia
KW  -  *electroacupuncture
KW  -  *thyroid surgery
