TI  -  A randomized noninferiority trial of electroacupuncture versus fast-track perioperative program for reducing duration of postoperative ileus and hospital stay after laparoscopic colorectal surgery
JA  -  Gastroenterology
PY  -  2017
VL  -  152
IS  -  5
SP  -  S1277
C3  -  EMBASE 618671614
M3  -  Journal article; Conference proceeding
KW  -  *cancer surgery
KW  -  *colorectal surgery
